
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cesar Bilingüe Imparable - Dashboard</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;margin:0;padding:30px}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;background:white;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
.hdr{background:#fff;border-bottom:4px solid #D0112B;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.hdr-title{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a}
.hdr-sub{font-size:13px;color:#666}
.hdr-logos{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}
.logo-box img{height:60px;width:auto}
.content{padding:24px}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.kpi{background:#fafafa;padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
.label{font-size:12px;color:#666;text-transform:uppercase}
.value{font-size:36px;font-weight:bold}
.red{color:#D0112B}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="hdr">
<div>
<div class="hdr-title">Cesar Bilingüe, Imparable</div>
<div class="hdr-sub">Tablero actualizado · 142 docentes únicos · 86.1% de avance</div>
</div>
<div class="hdr-logos">
<div class="logo-box">
<img src="LOG_UN_GENERAL_PRINCIPAL.png" alt="Universidad del Norte">
</div>
<div class="logo-box">
<img src="DrummondLTDOriginal (1).png" alt="Drummond">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="content">
<div class="kpis">
<div class="kpi"><div class="label">Inscritos únicos</div><div class="value">142</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="label">Meta</div><div class="value">165</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="label">Faltan</div><div class="value red">23</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="label">Avance</div><div class="value">86.1%</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
